# Architecture

Reference: `docs/PROJECT_CONSTITUTION.md`, `docs/FOLDER_STRUCTURE.md`, `docs/architecture/`

## Feature-first

- Features own business UI under `features/`.
- Shared UI lives in `components/`. Backend ownership lives in `convex/`.
- Prefer extending existing modules over parallel implementations.

## Layers

```text
UI → Application logic → Business logic → Convex → Database
```

- UI renders, interacts, and shows feedback.
- Business rules, permissions, validation, and integrity live in Convex.
- The frontend is never the source of truth.
- UI components must never decide business outcomes.

## Dependency flow

```text
app → features → components → hooks → lib → convex
```

- Dependencies point downward only.
- `components/` never call Convex or contain business rules.
- `app/` is routing and page assembly only.

## Tenancy

Every business record belongs to an organization. Resolve org from the session
profile. After `db.get`, assert organization. See `docs/architecture/MULTI_TENANT.md`.

## Offline

Local-first UX, Convex authority. See `docs/architecture/OFFLINE_SYNC.md`.

## Separation of concerns

One file, one responsibility. Do not combine fetching, business validation,
complex state, and rendering in the same file.
